    landLede: `A season of ${EX_FULL} products is ${PER_PRODUCT_VISUALS} images each — ${EX_VISUALS} finished images, cut for where they have to sit.`,
    // Eight destinations, one line each. The second line was a sentence per
    // channel until this pass; a list a reader scans does not need one.
